flowchart LR
    A[Raw Text String] --> B(SentenceTransformer)
    A --> C(TF-IDF Vectorizer)
    
    B --> |Dense Vector| V1[v_dense]
    C --> |Sparse Vector| V2[v_tfidf]
    
    B --> D[(Pre-computed Train Data)]
    D --> |Cosine Similarity| E(NearestNeighbors K=24)
    V1 --> E
    
    E --> |24 Neighbors x Dim| F(Vietoris-Rips)
    F --> |Persistence Diagram| G(Persistence Landscape)
    G --> |Landscape Features| V3[v_topo]
    
    V1 --> H{Concatenate}
    V2 --> H
    V3 --> H
    
    H --> |v_final| I(XGBoost Ensemble)
    
    I --> |"[P_pos, P_neg, P_neu]"| J{Ambiguity Evaluator}
    F --> |Loop Count| J
    
    J --> |Prob Gap < 0.30 AND Mod Loops| K[AMBIGUOUS]
    J --> |Loops > 14| K
    J --> |Prob Gap > 0.30 AND Low Loops| L[argmax Emotion]
